Third-party software
--------------------
Agrafeuse runs R in the web browser through webR (https://github.com/r-wasm/webr).
R and webR, and the R packages Agrafeuse loads at run time (ggplot2, dplyr,
tidyr, jsonlite, emmeans, lme4, lmerTest, nlme and their dependencies), are
downloaded from their own servers and are distributed under their own licenses;
R itself is licensed under the GNU GPL (version 2 or 3).
